tr.td:
SDM with log carbon intensity (
W 1
)

sec.p:
The baseline SDM produced a negative coefficient for digital economy development ($-$0.3423,
p &lt;
0.05). Negative and significant coefficients were also obtained when the spatial weight matrix was changed and when the 2024 observations were excluded; under the carbon-intensity specification the coefficient was positive and statistically insignificant.
